 "correction_note": "S-Skma W 4-R. RISM splits this one physical volume into six records (190027176-190027181), one per quartet, and both RISM and the Swedish catalogue call it a Musikhandskrift. It is in fact the Hummel print of opera prima (Amsterdam, J. J. Hummel) -- cf. RISM 990005852, which catalogues that edition. Recorded here as a correction, not asserted in RISM. — Catalogued as manuscript; identified as the Hummel print. Collection: Utile Dulci.",
